     H option(*nodebugio:*srcstmt)
     H dftactgrp(*no) actgrp(*CALLER) bnddir('WTBNDDIR')
    H/TITLE SR04317 - Employee Insured by General Contractor
     *===============================================================*
     * WC040317 - Endorsement Limiting and Restricting this Insurance*
     *            Employee Insured by General Contractor             *
     *                                                               *
      *   Single Manual attached endorsement                          *
     *   with no additional information entry needed                 *
     *                                                               *
     * Program Description:                                          *
     *                                                               *
     *   Determines if this endorsement form should be attached to   *
     *   the policy and creates data in the Endorsement Form         *
     *   Workfile (WXFMP) prior to a form merge.                     *
     *                                                               *
     *===============================================================*
     * REVISIONS:                                                    *
     *                                                               *
     * 06/09/08  C:61  Project 136WDS                                *
     *                 Created.                                      *
     *                                                               *
     *===============================================================*
     * Notes:                                                        *
     *                                                               *
     *  Utilizes the endorsement copybook (SCOPYEN01F/I/C).          *
     *                                                               *
     *  QQMODE = 1 - Called to determine if form should be attached. *
     *  QQMODE = 2 - Called to print endorsement.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 3 - Called for additional input.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 4 - Called for mid-term processing.                 *
     *===============================================================*
    
     ** Copybook F specs
     F/COPY SCOPYEN01F
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  Definition Specs
     *=========================================================================

     ** Copybook D specs
     D/COPY SCOPYEN01D
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  /COPY required constants
     *=========================================================================
    
     ** Form ID
     D qqform          c                   const('WC040317  ')
    
     ** Additional entry program
     D addpgm          c                   const('SRXXXXXXXX')
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  *LIKE DEFN definitions
     *=========================================================================
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  PLIST definitions
     *=========================================================================

     ** Entry parameters
     C     *entry        plist
     C                   parm                    qqco#             3
     C                   parm                    qqfnd             3
     C                   parm                    qqemp#            9
     C                   parm                    qqdiv             5
     C                   parm                    qqfyr             3
     C                   parm                    qqmode            1
     C                   parm                    qqrrn             9 0
     C                   parm                    qqmod2            1
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  KLIST definitions
     *=========================================================================
    
    
     *=========================================================================
     *  Main
     *=========================================================================
